{
  "_comment": "Red-flag rules are evaluated on every message and every answer, before any routine assessment. level=emergency stops the routine assessment and shows emergency guidance immediately; level=urgent adds 'get medical help today' guidance and keeps the assessment conservative; level=soon recommends booking a doctor's appointment. Every rule cites the passage it is based on (verified against corpus.jsonl by tests). `patterns` match raw user text; `all_symptoms` fires when every listed symptom is present; `with_any` requires at least one of those symptoms as well as the pattern/symptoms.",
  "emergency_contacts": {
    "en": "Call 112 (national emergency number) or 108 (ambulance) now, or go to the nearest hospital emergency department.",
    "hi": "Abhi 112 (emergency) ya 108 (ambulance) call karein, ya turant nearest hospital ki emergency mein jaayein."
  },
  "mental_health_contacts": {
    "en": "If you are thinking about harming yourself, call 112 now or Tele-MANAS at 14416 (free, 24x7). You are not alone.",
    "hi": "Agar aap khud ko nuksan pahunchane ka soch rahe hain, abhi 112 ya Tele-MANAS 14416 (free, 24x7) par call karein. Aap akele nahi hain."
  },
